    result: peel exactly ``proof_count`` proofs off the sealed
    state. Every resume commits one batch, so the batch the evidence
    records is exactly the suffix that turns the predecessor into
    the stored checkpoint. The predecessor for a first batch is the
    empty bootstrap."""
